---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
// The booking flow lives in one shared component so this page and the
// paid landing page cannot drift apart. See src/components/BookingWidget.astro.
import BookingWidget from '../components/BookingWidget.astro';
import LoomFacade from '../components/LoomFacade.astro';
import StatsStrip from '../components/StatsStrip.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Book a free strategy call - Moonraker" description="Book a free 30-minute strategy call with Scott Pope at Moonraker. We help therapy practices understand how they currently show up on Google, Maps, ChatGPT, Gemini, and AI tools." canonical="https://moonraker.ai/free-strategy-call" ogTitle="Book a free strategy call - Moonraker" ogDescription="A clear first call for therapy practices that shows whether Moonraker can help and where the biggest gaps are." ogUrl="https://moonraker.ai/free-strategy-call">
<main>

<div class="contact-wrap">
  <div class="contact-hero">
    <div class="contact-header">
      <h1>Book a free <span>strategy call.</span></h1>
      <p>A focused 30 minute call with Scott Pope, our Director of Growth and Operations. Scott leads every strategy call here, working hand in hand with founder Chris Morin, so you get the same depth of insight into how your practice shows up across Google, Maps, ChatGPT, Gemini, and other AI tools.</p>
    </div>
    <LoomFacade
      id="df3a5aa47f284ade81a4649695ac42dd"
      poster="strategy-call-video-poster"
      label="Play video: what a free strategy call with Moonraker looks like" />
  </div>
</div>

<BookingWidget />

<section class="band-mint">
  <div class="reviews-section">
  <div class="reviews-head">
    <div class="eyebrow">Reviews</div>
    <h2>Loved by practices like yours</h2>
    <p>Verified Google reviews from the therapists and practice owners we work with. Your free strategy call is the first step.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="reviews-grid">
    <article class="review-card">
      <div class="review-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
      <p class="review-quote">"Chris is amazing! We experienced a significant increase in traffic and inquiries through our website with his SEO knowledge. His honesty and transparency stand out, and his website design is absolutely stunning."</p>
      <div class="review-author"><div class="review-avatar">EE</div><div><div class="review-name">Erinn Everhart</div><div class="review-meta">Google review</div></div></div>
    </article>
    <article class="review-card">
      <div class="review-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
      <p class="review-quote">"I had no idea how much of an impact SEO could have on my business until I connected with Chris. He explained everything so clearly that I felt completely confident, and within just eight months my returns had already doubled."</p>
      <div class="review-author"><div class="review-avatar">G</div><div><div class="review-name">George</div><div class="review-meta">Google review</div></div></div>
    </article>
    <article class="review-card">
      <div class="review-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
      <p class="review-quote">"The results are amazing. Clicks, impressions, and my average position have all improved significantly. People are finding me through Google more than ever before, and the investment is paying off big time."</p>
      <div class="review-author"><div class="review-avatar">AS</div><div><div class="review-name">Audrey Schoen, LMFT</div><div class="review-meta">Google review</div></div></div>
    </article>
    <article class="review-card">
      <div class="review-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
      <p class="review-quote">"If you are a therapist looking for SEO strategy and implementation, Chris and his Moonraker team know how to rank you high on Google. I highly recommend them."</p>
      <div class="review-author"><div class="review-avatar">BS</div><div><div class="review-name">Brent Stutzman</div><div class="review-meta">Google review</div></div></div>
    </article>
    <article class="review-card">
      <div class="review-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
      <p class="review-quote">"I am not tech-savvy in any way. Chris is so knowledgeable and explains things in a way I can understand without being condescending. It is refreshing to work with someone as passionate about the mental health field as I am."</p>
      <div class="review-author"><div class="review-avatar">J</div><div><div class="review-name">Jennifer</div><div class="review-meta">Google review</div></div></div>
    </article>
    <article class="review-card">
      <div class="review-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
      <p class="review-quote">"Chris was responsive, answered our questions clearly, and explained things in a way that made sense. His help improved our SEO, and we appreciate his expertise. Highly recommend!"</p>
      <div class="review-author"><div class="review-avatar">KS</div><div><div class="review-name">Kelly Smyth-Dent</div><div class="review-meta">Google review</div></div></div>
    </article>
    <article class="review-card">
      <div class="review-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
      <p class="review-quote">"I honestly think Moonraker is the best choice anyone could make for digital marketing. I never would have attracted the clients I have, in the volume I have, without Chris' expertise. When you hire Chris it is like you have an entire team behind you."</p>
      <div class="review-author"><div class="review-avatar">BR</div><div><div class="review-name">Bambi Rattner, PsyD</div><div class="review-meta">Google review</div></div></div>
    </article>
    <article class="review-card">
      <div class="review-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
      <p class="review-quote">"In a very short amount of time Chris significantly improved the inbound traffic on my website. A significant chunk of the new business we have gained this past year is due to Chris and the excellent work he does at Moonraker."</p>
      <div class="review-author"><div class="review-avatar">CB</div><div><div class="review-name">Christopher Bagg</div><div class="review-meta">Google review</div></div></div>
    </article>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band-sage">
  <div class="partners-section">
  <h2 class="section-heading">Trusted by the experts who educate therapists</h2>
  <p class="section-subhead">We partner with the industry&rsquo;s most respected names in practice building, clinical training, and therapist entrepreneurship.</p>
  <div class="partners-rows">
    <div class="partner-row cols-3">
      <img class="partner-logo" src="/assets/partners/private-practice-elevation-h160.avif" alt="Private Practice Elevation logo" title="Private Practice Elevation logo" width="285" height="150" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <img class="partner-logo" src="/assets/partners/traveling-therapist-h160.avif" alt="The Traveling Therapist logo" title="The Traveling Therapist logo" width="300" height="264" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <img class="partner-logo" src="/assets/partners/private-practice-academy-h160.avif" alt="The Private Practice Academy logo" title="The Private Practice Academy logo" width="900" height="206" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </div>
    <div class="partner-row cols-2">
      <img class="partner-logo" src="/assets/partners/therasaas-h160.avif" alt="TheraSaaS logo" title="TheraSaaS logo" width="350" height="180" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <img class="partner-logo" src="/assets/partners/intensive-therapy-coach-h160.avif" alt="Intensive Therapy Coach logo" title="Intensive Therapy Coach logo" width="1000" height="565" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </div>
    <div class="partner-row cols-2">
      <img class="partner-logo" src="/assets/partners/prosperous-therapist-h160.avif" alt="The Prosperous Therapist logo" title="The Prosperous Therapist logo" width="300" height="100" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
      <img class="partner-logo" src="/assets/partners/mccance-method-h160.avif" alt="The McCance Method logo" title="The McCance Method logo" width="500" height="320" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
    </div>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>

<StatsStrip />

</main>

</BaseLayout>
<style>
/* Page-specific styles. Tokens come from /styles/globals.css. */

.contact-wrap {
  position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  background: linear-gradient(158deg, var(--color-navy) 0%, var(--color-navy-deep) 100%);
  color: var(--color-on-navy-dim);
  padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem) 2rem clamp(4rem, 7vw, 6rem);
}
.contact-wrap::before {
  content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0;
  background-image:
    linear-gradient(to right, oklch(0.945 0.018 166 / 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
    linear-gradient(to bottom, oklch(0.945 0.018 166 / 0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size: 62px 62px;
  -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(80% 120% at 50% 0%, #000 0%, transparent 72%);
  mask-image: radial-gradient(80% 120% at 50% 0%, #000 0%, transparent 72%);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.contact-wrap > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
.contact-hero { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr .95fr; gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4rem); align-items: center; }
.contact-header { text-align: left; }
.contact-header h1 {
  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-weight: 800;
  font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.7rem); line-height: 1.05; color: var(--color-on-navy);
  margin-bottom: 1rem; letter-spacing: -.02em;
}
.contact-header h1 span { color: var(--color-primary); }
.contact-header p {
  font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--color-on-navy-dim);
  line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;
}

/* TZ banner */
@media (max-width: 720px) {
  .contact-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}
/* Reviews */
.reviews-section { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem) 2rem clamp(4rem, 7vw, 6rem); }
.reviews-head { text-align: center; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
.reviews-head .eyebrow { color: var(--color-primary-text); font-weight: 800; font-size: .78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; margin-bottom: .7rem; }
.reviews-head h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.4vw, 2.6rem); color: var(--color-heading); margin-bottom: .6rem; }
.reviews-head p { color: var(--color-muted); line-height: 1.7; }
.reviews-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; }
.review-card { background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-hairline); border-radius: var(--r-lg); padding: 1.5rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .85rem; }
.review-stars { color: #f59e0b; font-size: 1.05rem; letter-spacing: .12em; }
.review-quote { color: var(--color-body); line-height: 1.6; font-size: .98rem; flex: 1; }
.review-author { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem; }
.review-avatar { width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--color-navy); color: var(--color-primary); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: .9rem; flex-shrink: 0; }
.review-name { font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-heading); font-size: .92rem; }
.review-meta { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: .8rem; }
/* Partners */
.partners-section { padding: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem) 2rem clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem); max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
.partners-section .section-heading { font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: clamp(2.05rem, 3.4vw, 3.1rem); letter-spacing: -.022em; color: var(--color-heading); margin-bottom: .5rem; }
.partners-section .section-subhead { font-size: 1.0625rem; color: var(--color-muted); max-width: 540px; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem; }
.partners-rows { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 2rem; }
.partner-row { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 2rem 3rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.partner-logo { height: 80px; max-width: 200px; object-fit: contain; opacity: .85; }
html.dark .partner-logo { filter: brightness(1.1) contrast(1.05); opacity: .75; }
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  .partner-row { gap: 1.25rem 1.5rem; width: 100%; }
  .partner-row .partner-logo { height: auto; max-height: 52px; max-width: none; object-fit: contain; }
  .partner-row.cols-3 .partner-logo { width: calc(33.33% - 1.2rem); }
  .partner-row.cols-2 .partner-logo { width: calc(50% - 1rem); }
}
</style>
